# Every screen of the morse notepad, for docs/apps/morse.md: some keyed text, a letter in progress, and the clear question.
open app morse
swipe down                  # h: four dots
swipe down
swipe down
swipe down
tap 120 120                 # end the letter
swipe down                  # i: two dots
swipe down
tap 120 120
swipe right                 # a space
swipe up                    # a letter in progress: dot, line
swipe down
expect text "hi"
expect text "-."
snapshot keying
long-press 120 120
expect text "Clear all the text?"
snapshot clear
tap 181 115                 # yes
expect no text "hi"
expect no failures
